Package: strRegression
Title: Structure of Regression Functions
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Internal functions for the structure of a linear regression
    model with random regressors: the model-implied covariance matrix
    from the regression parameters, partial and standardized slopes,
    R-squared and adjusted R-squared, semipartial and partial
    correlations, Cohen's f-squared, selective standardization,
    parameter index helpers, and the Jacobian matrices of these quantities.
    The functions have no input checks and are copied by other projects.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/strRegression, https://ijapesigan.github.io/strRegression/
BugReports: https://github.com/ijapesigan/strRegression/issues
